{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Talk to Us — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Contact the team for membership details, private sessions and events in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f6fbfb;--card:#ffffff;--ink:#123;--muted:#556;--accent:#6aa9c6;--accent-2:#8bd3d9;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);}    
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f1f7f8);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    .site{min-height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px;background:transparent}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav{display:flex;gap:16px}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px}
    nav a.active,nav a:hover{background:var(--card);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)}
    .container{width:100%;max-width:1050px;margin:24px auto;padding:24px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:20px}
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(255,255,255,0.8));padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(18,30,40,0.06)}
    .kicker{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)}
    .contact-card{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(18,30,40,0.04)}
    form .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #e3eef0;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}
    button.cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border:none;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Proof gallery */
    .proof{margin-top:18px;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.5),rgba(255,255,255,0.85));}
    .testimonial{min-height:86px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
    .quote{font-size:15px;color:#0b2a2e;margin:0 0 8px}
    .who{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .proof-controls{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-left:auto}
    .badge{background:var(--card);padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;border:1px solid #e8f1f2;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;position:relative}
    .badge svg{width:18px;height:18px}
    .tooltip{position:absolute;bottom:calc(100% + 8px);left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#072; color:#fff;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;display:none}
    .badge:hover .tooltip{display:block}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .comparator{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--card),#ffffff);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6eef0}
    .switch{display:flex;gap:6px;background:#f2fbfc;padding:6px;border-radius:999px;align-items:center;width:260px}
    .opt{flex:1;text-align:center;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
    .opt.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#fff}
    .priceRow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:10px}
    .price{font-size:22px;font-weight:700}
    .subtitle{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    footer{margin-top:28px;padding:18px;border-top:1px solid #e8f2f3;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}

    @media (max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.badges{display:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="site">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">SB</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="muted" style="font-size:12px">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Site navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="events.html">Gatherings</a>
        <a href="private-sessions.html">Private Flow</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Plans</a>
        <a href="about.html">About the Space</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book a Mat</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="active">Talk to Us</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
      <div class="grid">
        <section class="hero">
          <div class="kicker">Talk with a guide</div>
          <h1>Connect about membership, private sessions and events</h1>
          <p class="lead">Prefer a quick chat or a detailed plan? Use this page to reach our team for membership onboarding, bespoke private session planning, or to check event accessibility in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</p>

          <div class="contact-card" style="margin-top:14px">
            <form id="contactForm">
              <div class="row" style="margin-bottom:10px">
                <input name="name" placeholder="Your full name" required>
                <input name="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)" aria-label="phone">
              </div>
              <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
                <input name="email" placeholder="Email" type="email" required>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
                <select name="topic">
                  <option value="membership">Ask about membership</option>
                  <option value="events">Upcoming gatherings</option>
                  <option value="private">Private sessions</option>
                  <option value="other">Other</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div style="margin-bottom:10px">
                <textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us what you're hoping for..."></textarea>
              </div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
                <button class="cta" type="submit">Start the conversation</button>
                <div class="muted">Or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
              </div>
            </form>
            <div id="formResult" style="display:none;margin-top:12px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:#f0fffe;color:#073;">Thanks — we will reply within 48 hours. If urgent, call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a>.</div>
          </div>

          <div class="proof">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Proof Gallery</div>
              <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">short rotating notes from members</div>
              <div class="badges" role="list">
                <div class="badge" role="listitem" aria-label="Wellness Collective">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#6aa9c6" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M8 12h8" stroke="#6aa9c6" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
                  <div class="tooltip">Featured in Wellness Collective — curated listing</div>
                </div>
                <div class="badge" role="listitem" aria-label="Community Verified">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="3" stroke="#8bd3d9" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M7 12l3 3 7-7" stroke="#8bd3d9" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                  <div class="tooltip">Community verified — steady attendance</div>
                </div>
                <div class="badge" role="listitem" aria-label="Press mention">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M12 3v18" stroke="#b3dfe2" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M3 12h18" stroke="#b3dfe2" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
                  <div class="tooltip">Mentioned in local press</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div id="testimonialRoot" class="testimonial" style="margin-top:12px">
              <p class="quote" id="quote">Loading...</p>
              <div class="who" id="who"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="proof-controls">
              <div style="display:flex;gap:6px">
                <button id="prev" aria-label="previous" style="padding:6px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6eef0;background:#fff">◀</button>
                <button id="next" aria-label="next" style="padding:6px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6eef0;background:#fff">▶</button>
              </div>
              <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">Members rotating highlights</div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </section>

        <aside>
          <div class="comparator">
            <div style="font-weight:700">Quick pricing preview</div>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:10px">Compare membership vs package credit — numbers update with a friendly animation.</div>
            <div class="switch" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing toggle" id="toggle">
              <div class="opt active" data-mode="monthly">Monthly Membership</div>
              <div class="opt" data-mode="package">4-Session Package</div>
            </div>
            <div class="priceRow">
              <div>
                <div class="price" id="price">—</div>
                <div class="subtitle" id="priceSubtitle">Loading</div>
              </div>
              <div style="text-align:right">
                <div class="muted">Per person</div>
                <div style="font-size:12px;margin-top:8px"><a href="pricing.html">Full plan details</a></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:16px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbffff);border:1px solid #e6eef0">
            <div style="font-weight:700">Contraindications & notes</div>
            <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:8px">Sound experiences are relaxing but not suitable for everyone. People with the following should consult their physician before attending:</div>
            <ul class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin:10px 0 0;padding-left:18px">
              <li>Recent surgeries or open wounds</li>
              <li>Care-managed epilepsy or seizure disorder</li>
              <li>Severe psychiatric conditions without clinician approval</li>
              <li>Pregnancy with complications — seek medical counsel</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </aside>

      </div>

      <section style="margin-top:22px" aria-labelledby="helpTitle">
        <h2 id="helpTitle">Other ways to reach us</h2>
        <p class="muted">If you'd like a direct introduction to our membership benefits, request a complimentary orientation by selecting "Ask about membership" above. For booking private sessions we reply with available windows and a short intake questionnaire.</p>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      <div style="margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">Membership is an ongoing support offering; private sessions are scheduled separately. Learn more on the Plans page.</div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Testimonials + rotating proof gallery
    const testimonials = [
      {text: 'I keep returning for the calm reset — the instructors are precise and reassuring.', who: 'S. R., member'},
      {text: 'A clean, quiet setting and real attention to accessibility. I appreciated the follow-up.', who: 'L. M., attendee'},
      {text: 'Effectively reduced my pre-sleep restlessness after a few sessions.', who: 'D. K., member'},
      {text: 'We booked a private session for a group and the guide tailored the sequence perfectly.', who: 'Corporate HR'}
    ];
    let tIndex = 0;
    const quoteEl = document.getElementById('quote');
    const whoEl = document.getElementById('who');
    function showTest(i){
      const item = testimonials[i % testimonials.length];
      quoteEl.style.opacity = 0;
      whoEl.style.opacity = 0;
      setTimeout(()=>{
        quoteEl.textContent = '"' + item.text + '"';
        whoEl.textContent = item.who;
        quoteEl.style.opacity = 1;
        whoEl.style.opacity = 1;
      },220);
    }
    document.getElementById('next').addEventListener('click',()=>{ tIndex = (tIndex+1)%testimonials.length; showTest(tIndex); });
    document.getElementById('prev').addEventListener('click',()=>{ tIndex = (tIndex-1+testimonials.length)%testimonials.length; showTest(tIndex); });
    showTest(0);
    setInterval(()=>{ tIndex = (tIndex+1)%testimonials.length; showTest(tIndex); },5000);

    // Simple pricing comparator with animated numbers
    const modes = {
      monthly: {price: 48, subtitle: 'Billed monthly — access to weekly gatherings and member perks'},
      package: {price: 160, subtitle: 'Four-session package — use across gatherings or private bookings'}
    };
    let currentMode = 'monthly';
    const priceEl = document.getElementById('price');
    const subEl = document.getElementById('priceSubtitle');

    function animateNumber(el, start, end, duration=600){
      const startTime = performance.now();
      function step(now){
        const t = Math.min(1,(now-startTime)/duration);
        const val = Math.round(start + (end - start) * (1 - Math.cos(t * Math.PI))/2);
        el.textContent = '$' + val;
        if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(step);
    }

    function setMode(mode){
      if(!modes[mode]) return;
      const target = modes[mode];
      const currentVal = Number((priceEl.textContent||'$0').replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')) || (mode==='monthly'?0:0);
      animateNumber(priceEl,currentVal,target.price);
      subEl.textContent = target.subtitle;
      document.querySelectorAll('.opt').forEach(el=>el.classList.toggle('active', el.dataset.mode===mode));
      currentMode = mode;
    }
    document.getElementById('toggle').addEventListener('click', (e)=>{
      const opt = e.target.closest('.opt');
      if(!opt) return;
      setMode(opt.dataset.mode);
    });
    setMode('monthly');

    // Contact form handling (local only)
    const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
    form.addEventListener('submit', (ev)=>{
      ev.preventDefault();
      const fd = new FormData(form);
      // Simple client-side validation already enforced; show success
      document.getElementById('formResult').style.display = 'block';
      form.reset();
      // For convenience, open mail client with summary (if user prefers):
      const subject = encodeURIComponent('Contact from site: ' + (fd.get('topic')||'General'));
      const body = encodeURIComponent('Name: ' + (fd.get('name')||'') + '\nEmail: ' + (fd.get('email')||'') + '\nPhone: ' + (fd.get('phone')||'') + '\n\n' + (fd.get('message')||''));
      // Provide a gentle option to send via user's mail client
      const mailAnchor = document.createElement('a');
      mailAnchor.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=' + subject + '&body=' + body;
      mailAnchor.style.display = 'none';
      document.body.appendChild(mailAnchor);
      setTimeout(()=>{document.body.removeChild(mailAnchor);},2000);
    });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"This chunk contains the contact page and a short README for the sound bath site.

Files included:
- contact.html : The site contact page used across the layoutFamily 'clinic_modern' and voiceFamily 'clinical_calm'.

Key features implemented in contact.html:
- Local navigation with unique labels linking to: index.html, events.html, private-sessions.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html.
- Contact form (no backend). On submit the form shows a confirmation message and prepares a mailto link for convenience.
- Proof Gallery: rotating testimonials with manual prev/next and auto-advance. Credibility badges show tooltips on hover.
- Micro Pricing Comparator: toggle between 'Monthly Membership' and '4-Session Package' with animated price transitions.
- Contraindications: responsible short list advising medical consultation where appropriate.
- Uses an SVG pattern via CSS background: url('assets/img/pattern.svg') — the SVG asset is expected elsewhere in the bundle.

Placeholders to be replaced elsewhere in the build:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}

Notes:
- No external fonts, CDNs or images are used. All interactions are implemented with vanilla JS and inline CSS.
- Other site pages (events.html, pricing.html etc.) are referenced but not included in this chunk.

Testing:
- Open contact.html in a browser. The testimonial gallery should rotate automatically. Toggle pricing to see animated numbers.
- Submit the contact form to view the confirmation message.

Accessibility:
- Basic aria labels and roles are set on navigation, toggle, and badge lists for assistive tech.

If you need this page adapted for server-side form handling, add an action attribute to the form element and secure the backend endpoint accordingly."}
BUNDLE_END
